 app affiancate, ma non offre la stessa libertà del multitasking di Split View su iPad. Ecco come cambia l’esperienza.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/iphone-duo-split-view-app-affiancate-featured-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-duo-split-view-app-affiancate-featured\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17712,\"date\":\"2026-09-13T12:24:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-13T10:24:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-nuovi-accessori-iphone-18-pro-airpods-pro-3-laccetto-polso-custodia-trasparente\",\"title\":\"Apple presenta i nuovi accessori per iPhone 18 Pro e AirPods Pro 3: laccetto da polso e custodia trasparente aggiornata\",\"excerpt\":\"Con iPhone 18 Pro e AirPods Pro 3 arrivano nuovi accessori: debutta un laccetto da polso e la custodia trasparente viene aggiornata. Ecco cosa cambia.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/iphone-18-pro-accessori-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-18-pro-accessori\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17729,\"date\":\"2026-09-13T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-13T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-store-offline-preordini-iphone-18-pro-18-pro-max-14-00\",\"title\":\"L’Apple Store è offline: alle 14:00 partono i preordini di iPhone 18 Pro e 18 Pro Max\",\"excerpt\":\"L’Apple Store Online è in manutenzione e tornerà disponibile alle 14:00, quando partiranno i preordini di iPhone 18 Pro e iPhone 18 Pro Max.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/apple-store-iphone-18-pro-preordine-dayone-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-store-iphone-18-pro-preordine-dayone\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17718,\"date\":\"2026-09-13T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-13T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-dirigenti-spiegano-design-display-riservatezza-prezzo-iphone-duo\",\"title\":\"Apple: i dirigenti spiegano design del display, riservatezza e prezzo di iPhone Duo\",\"excerpt\":\"I dirigenti Apple avrebbero discusso il design del display, la strategia di riservatezza e le logiche di prezzo legate a iPhone Duo, secondo indiscrezioni sul progetto.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/iphone-duo-ternus-joz-interview-techradar-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-duo-ternus-joz-interview-techradar\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17716,\"date\":\"2026-09-13T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-13T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"come-ricaricare-iphone-18-pro-alla-massima-velocita-caricatori-e-cavi-giusti\",\"title\":\"Come ricaricare iPhone 18 Pro alla massima velocità: caricatori e cavi giusti\",\"excerpt\":\"Per sfruttare la ricarica più rapida di iPhone 18 Pro serve la combinazione corretta di caricatore e cavo. Ecco cosa usare per ottenere la massima velocità.\",\"categoryName\":\"Guide\",\"categorySlug\":\"guide\",\"categoryId\":196,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/iphone-18-pro-fast-charge-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-18-pro-fast-charge-1\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17710,\"date\":\"2026-09-13T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-13T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-piu-facile-da-riparare-di-iphone-17-pro-punteggi-etichet